    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335390/extras/f61ca169536d7519e49a90313ee87d51.avif?t=1750348256\" width=720 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335390/extras/735e30e9371c391bc75cd0ca4abae8fb.poster.avif?t=1750348256\" width=622 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335390/extras/735e30e9371c391bc75cd0ca4abae8fb.webm?t=1750348256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335390/extras/735e30e9371c391bc75cd0ca4abae8fb.mp4?t=1750348256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexbot Lab is a fully animated game featuring crossword-like mechanics, but unlike typical crossword games, Nova rewards you after every correct word. Sometimes, your reward is a customization option. Other times, it\u2019s a steamy conversation, a sex scene, or a surprise of another kind~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect in the Full Version:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>225</strong> words with various interactions for you to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>75</strong> customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of new rewards with Nova, like cum shots, impregnation, and more, to mix with customizations for endless fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335390/extras/96de0bfa81624d9a7b3194a55cc59bf4.poster.avif?t